# Public Supabase client config. These values are shipped to the browser, so they
# are safe to commit. Tracking them here guarantees every build (local, CI, any
# machine) bakes them into the bundle — a build without them produces a broken
# worker that 500s on every route (createClient throws "supabaseUrl is required.").
# Server-only secrets (service-role key, Resend) live in .dev.vars / Worker secrets.
